This plugin adapts code from paseo-math (Apache-2.0):
https://github.com/q5m-ai/paseo-math/tree/3644aa73d40f2e4e51f7a4ef48b22b668db017d8
Copyright 2026 q5m-ai contributors.
Adapted files carry a header naming their origin. The adapted parts are:
the Markdown math tokenizer (shared/markdown/math.ts), TeX normalization
helpers (shared/tex.ts), the MathJax + resvg rasterizer (server/math/render.ts),
the client formula layout (client/formula.tsx, client/formula-scale.ts,
client/render-cache.ts, client/fit-image.ts), and the build-time stable
Markdown node-key and class-lowering steps (scripts/build.mjs).

paseo-math in turn draws on the public Paseo LaTeX proposal
https://github.com/getpaseo/paseo/pull/2562 and the Paseo stable node-key patch
https://github.com/getpaseo/paseo/blob/c43df5d4c398571f62584b4ad5a629b5fd3b4599/patches/react-native-markdown-display%2B7.0.2.patch
Paseo is Copyright 2025-present Mohamed Boudra, Apache-2.0.

